            TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2000 1 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2000 1 1) (YearMonthDay 2000 1 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE
            `I revoked my consent before it took effect` `my consent was made irrevocable` 0)

@export May a copy or facsimile of a written consent be used instead of the original (s 228(d)(2))?
GIVEN `the copy is a complete reproduction of the entire original writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the copy, facsimile or other reproduction a complete reproduction of the entire original writing?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May a copy or facsimile of a written consent be used instead of the original (s 228(d)(2))` IF
    `s 228(d)(2) the reproduction may be used in lieu of the original writing` `the copy is a complete reproduction of the entire original writing`

@export Is a consent that I documented and signed under section 116 treated as in writing (s 228(d)(2))?
GIVEN `I documented and signed it in accordance with s 116` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the consent documented and signed in accordance with section 116?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a consent that I documented and signed under section 116 treated as in writing (s 228(d)(2))` IF
    `s 228(d)(2) the consent is deemed to be in writing` `I documented and signed it in accordance with s 116`

§§ `If an action has been taken by consent that was not unanimous (section 228(e))`

-- s 228(e). The stockholder's side.
@export Must I be told promptly that the action was taken by consent, when I did not consent (s 228(e))?
GIVEN `the action was taken by less than unanimous consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the action taken by less than unanimous consent?
      `I was a stockholder or member on the record date for the action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you a stockholder or member on the record date for the action by consent?
      `I consented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you consent to the action?
      `I would have been entitled to notice of a meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would you have been entitled to notice of the meeting if the action had been taken at a meeting, with the record date for the meeting notice being the record date for the action by consent?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must I be told promptly that the action was taken by consent, when I did not consent (s 228(e))` IF
    `s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` `the action was taken by less than unanimous consent` `I was a stockholder or member on the record date for the action` `I consented` `I would have been entitled to notice of a meeting`

-- s 228(e), the other side of the same relation: the officer or director who has to give the notice.
@export Must we give this stockholder prompt notice that we took the action by consent (s 228(e))?
GIVEN `the action was taken by less than unanimous consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the action taken by less than unanimous consent?
      `the person was a stockholder or member on the record date for the action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the person a stockholder or member on the record date for the action by consent?
      `the person consented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person consent to the action?
      `the person would have been entitled to notice of a meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the person have been entitled to notice of the meeting if the action had been taken at a meeting?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must we give this stockholder prompt notice that we took the action by consent (s 228(e))` IF
    `s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` `the action was taken by less than unanimous consent` `the person was a stockholder or member on the record date for the action` `the person consented` `the person would have been entitled to notice of a meeting`

@export May we give that notice as a notice of internet availability of proxy materials (s 228(e))?
GIVEN `the notice is a notice of internet availability of proxy materials` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice constitute a notice of internet availability of proxy materials under the rules under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May we give that notice as a notice of internet availability of proxy materials (s 228(e))` IF
    `s 228(e) the notice may be provided by a notice of internet availability of proxy materials` `the notice is a notice of internet availability of proxy materials`

@export Must the certificate we file say that consent was given instead of stating a vote (s 228(e))?
GIVEN `the action would have needed a certificate if voted on at a meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action one that would have required the filing of a certificate under another section of the Law if it had been voted on by stockholders or members at a meeting?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must the certificate we file say that consent was given instead of stating a vote (s 228(e))` IF
    `s 228(e) the certificate must state that consent has been given in accordance with section 228 in lieu of the statement about a vote` `the action would have needed a certificate if voted on at a meeting`

§ `Section 229 -- waiver of notice`

@export Is notice waived as to me (s 229)?
GIVEN `I signed a written waiver` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you sign a written waiver of notice (before or after the time stated for the notice)?
      `I gave a waiver by electronic transmission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you give a waiver of notice by electronic transmission?
      `I attended the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you attend the meeting of which notice was required?
      `I attended only to object that the meeting was not lawfully called` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you attend for the express purpose of objecting, at the beginning of the meeting, to the transaction of any business because the meeting is not lawfully called or convened?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is notice waived as to me (s 229)` IF
    `s 229 notice is waived` `my waiver`
    WHERE
        `my waiver` MEANS `dg5 s 229 Waiver of notice` WITH
              `the person entitled to notice signed a written waiver` IS `I signed a written waiver`
            , `the person entitled to notice gave a waiver by electronic transmission` IS `I gave a waiver by electronic transmission`
            , `the person attended the meeting of which notice was required` IS `I attended the meeting`
            , `the person attended for the express purpose of objecting at the beginning of the meeting to the transaction of any business because the meeting is not lawfully called or convened` IS `I attended only to object that the meeting was not lawfully called`

@export Must a waiver of notice say what business the meeting will transact (s 229)?
GIVEN `the certificate or the bylaws require it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws require a waiver of notice to specify the business to be transacted or the purpose of the meeting?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must a waiver of notice say what business the meeting will transact (s 229)` IF
    `s 229 the waiver must specify the business or the purpose of the meeting` (`dg5 seat where the provision is made` `the certificate or the bylaws require it`)

§ `Section 230 -- when notice is not required`

@export Is the corporation excused from giving me notice because communication with me is unlawful (s 230(a))?
GIVEN `communication with me is unlawful` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is communication with you unlawful?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the corporation excused from giving me notice because communication with me is unlawful (s 230(a))` IF
    `s 230(a) notice is not required to the person` `communication with me is unlawful`

@export Is an action taken without notice to me valid when communication with me is unlawful (s 230(a))?
GIVEN `communication with me is unlawful` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is communication with you unlawful?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is an action taken without notice to me valid when communication with me is unlawful (s 230(a))` IS
    `s 230(a) the action or meeting held without notice to the person has the same force and effect as if notice had been given` `communication with me is unlawful`

@export Must the certificate say that notice was given to everyone except those with whom communication is unlawful (s 230(a))?
GIVEN `the action needs a certificate under another section` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action one that requires the filing of a certificate under another section of the Law?
      `notice is required` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is notice required?
      `some persons entitled to notice cannot lawfully be communicated with` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are there persons entitled to notice with whom communication is unlawful?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must the certificate say that notice was given to everyone except those with whom communication is unlawful (s 230(a))` IF
    `s 230(a) the certificate must state that notice was given to all persons entitled to receive notice except those with whom communication is unlawful` `the action needs a certificate under another section` `notice is required` `some persons entitled to notice cannot lawfully be communicated with`

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      s IS A NUMBER
      r IS A NUMBER
      ad IS A BOOLEAN
      et IS A BOOLEAN
      em IS A BOOLEAN
      pr IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 230(b) Notices and payments returned undeliverable`
`dg5 seat returned mail` a b s r ad et em pr MEANS
    `dg5 s 230(b) Notices and payments returned undeliverable` WITH
          `notices of 2 consecutive annual meetings were mailed to the person at the address on the corporation's records and returned undeliverable` IS a
        , `all notices of meetings or of the taking of action by written consent mailed to the person between those 2 consecutive annual meetings were returned undeliverable` IS b
        , `the number of payments of dividends or interest on securities sent to the person by first-class mail during a 12-month period` IS s
        , `the number of those payments returned undeliverable` IS r
        , `the person delivered to the corporation a written notice setting forth the person's then current address` IS ad
        , `a returned notice was given by electronic transmission` IS et
        , `the person's electronic mail address appears on the records of the corporation` IS em
        , `notice by electronic transmission to the person is prohibited by s 232` IS pr

@export May the corporation stop giving me notice because its mail to me came back undeliverable (s 230(b))?
GIVEN `notices of two annual meetings came back` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were notices of 2 consecutive annual meetings mailed to you at your address on the corporation's records and returned undeliverable?
      `all notices between those meetings came back` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were all notices of meetings, and of the taking of action by written consent, mailed to you between those 2 annual meetings also returned undeliverable?
      `dividend or interest payments sent by first-class mail in 12 months` IS A NUMBER @desc How many payments of dividends or interest on securities were sent to you by first-class mail during a 12-month period?
      `of those, the number that came back` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those payments were returned undeliverable?
