      `a returned notice was given electronically` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a returned notice one that was given by electronic transmission?
      `my e-mail address is on the corporation's records` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your electronic mail address appear on the corporation's records?
      `electronic notice to me is prohibited by section 232` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is notice to you by electronic transmission prohibited by section 232?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation stop giving me notice because its mail to me came back undeliverable (s 230(b))` IF
    `s 230(b) notice need not be given to the stockholder or member` (`dg5 seat returned mail` `notices of two annual meetings came back` `all notices between those meetings came back` `dividend or interest payments sent by first-class mail in 12 months` `of those, the number that came back` `I gave the corporation my current address in writing` `a returned notice was given electronically` `my e-mail address is on the corporation's records` `electronic notice to me is prohibited by section 232`)

@export Does the returned-mail exception fail to apply to me because of my e-mail address (s 230(c))?
GIVEN `a returned notice was given electronically` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a returned notice one that was given by electronic transmission?
      `my e-mail address is on the corporation's records` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your electronic mail address appear on the corporation's records?
      `electronic notice to me is prohibited by section 232` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is notice to you by electronic transmission prohibited by section 232?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the returned-mail exception fail to apply to me because of my e-mail address (s 230(c))` IF
    `s 230(c) the exception in paragraph (b)(1) is not applicable`
        (`dg5 seat returned mail`
