DECIDE `Is an action taken without notice to me valid, when the corporation's mail to me came back (s 230(b))` IS
    `s 230(b) the action or meeting held without notice to the person has the same force and effect as if notice had been given` (`dg5 seat returned mail` `notices of two annual meetings came back` `all notices between those meetings came back` `dividend or interest payments sent by first-class mail in 12 months` `of those, the number that came back` `I gave the corporation my current address in writing` `a returned notice was given electronically` `my e-mail address is on the corporation's records` `electronic notice to me is prohibited by section 232`)

§ `Section 231 -- inspectors of election`

GIVEN l IS A BOOLEAN
      q IS A BOOLEAN
      n IS A NUMBER
      ot IS A BOOLEAN
      pv IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 231(e) Voting stock of the corporation`
`dg5 seat voting stock` l q n ot pv MEANS
    `dg5 s 231(e) Voting stock of the corporation` WITH
          `the corporation has a class of voting stock that is listed on a national securities exchange` IS l
        , `the corporation has a class of voting stock that is authorized for quotation on an interdealer quotation system of a registered national securities association` IS q
        , `the number of stockholders of record of the class of voting stock held of record by the most stockholders` IS n
        , `where a provision otherwise providing is made` IS `dg5 seat where the provision is made` ot
        , `that provision makes section 231 apply to the corporation` IS pv

@export Does section 231 apply to my corporation, so that it must use inspectors of election (s 231(e))?
GIVEN `a class of voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation have a class of voting stock listed on a national securities exchange?
      `a class of voting stock is quoted on an interdealer quotation system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it have a class of voting stock authorized for quotation on an interdealer quotation system of a registered national securities association?
      `the most holders of record of any class of voting stock` IS A NUMBER @desc How many stockholders of record hold the class of voting stock that has the most holders of record?
      `the certificate or the bylaws say the section applies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws provide that section 231 applies to the corporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does section 231 apply to my corporation, so that it must use inspectors of election (s 231(e))` IF
    `s 231(e) section 231 applies to the corporation` (`dg5 seat voting stock` `a class of voting stock is listed on a national securities exchange` `a class of voting stock is quoted on an interdealer quotation system` `the most holders of record of any class of voting stock` `the certificate or the bylaws say the section applies` `the certificate or the bylaws say the section applies`)

@export Who must appoint the inspectors of election for the stockholders' meeting (s 231(a))?
GIVEN `section 231 applies to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does section 231 apply to the corporation (it has a listed or quoted class of voting stock, or a class held of record by more than 2,000 stockholders, or its certificate or bylaws say so)?
      `no inspector or alternate is able to act at the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that no inspector or alternate inspector is able to act at the meeting?
GIVETH A `dg5 s 231(a) Who appoints the inspectors`
DECIDE `Who must appoint the inspectors of election for the stockholders' meeting (s 231(a))` IS
    `s 231(a) who must appoint the inspectors` `section 231 applies to the corporation` `no inspector or alternate is able to act at the meeting`

@export May I act as an inspector of election after taking an oath (s 231(a))?
GIVEN `I took and signed the oath` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you taken and signed an oath faithfully to execute the duties of inspector with strict impartiality and according to the best of your ability?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May I act as an inspector of election after taking an oath (s 231(a))` IF
    `s 231(a) the inspector may enter upon the discharge of the duties of inspector` `I took and signed the oath`

@export Have the inspectors done what the Law requires of them (s 231(b))?
GIVEN `they ascertained the shares outstanding and the voting power of each` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the inspectors ascertain the number of shares outstanding and the voting power of each?
      `they determined the shares represented and the validity of proxies and ballots` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did they determine the shares represented at the meeting and the validity of proxies and ballots?
      `they counted all votes and ballots` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did they count all votes and ballots?
      `they retained a record of the disposition of challenges` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did they determine and retain, for a reasonable period, a record of the disposition of any challenges made to any determination by them?
      `they certified the number of shares represented and the count` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did they certify their determination of the number of shares represented at the meeting and their count of all votes and ballots?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Have the inspectors done what the Law requires of them (s 231(b))` IF
    `s 231(b) the inspectors have performed their duties`
        (`dg5 s 231(b) What the inspectors have done` OF `they ascertained the shares outstanding and the voting power of each`, `they determined the shares represented and the validity of proxies and ballots`, `they counted all votes and ballots`, `they retained a record of the disposition of challenges`, `they certified the number of shares represented and the count`)

@export May the inspectors appoint or retain others to assist them (s 231(b))?
GIVEN `the inspectors are acting at a meeting to which section 231 applies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the inspectors acting at a meeting to which section 231 applies?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the inspectors appoint or retain others to assist them (s 231(b))` IF
    `s 231(b) the inspectors may appoint or retain other persons or entities to assist them` `the inspectors are acting at a meeting to which section 231 applies`

@export Must the opening and the closing of the polls be announced at the meeting (s 231(c))?
GIVEN `the date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls were announced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls for the matter announced at the meeting?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must the opening and the closing of the polls be announced at the meeting (s 231(c))` IF
    `s 231(c) the announcement of the opening and the closing of the polls was made as the subsection requires` `the date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls were announced`

@export May the inspectors accept my proxy or ballot after the polls have closed (s 231(c))?
GIVEN `it was received after the closing of the polls` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was your ballot, proxy, vote, revocation or change received after the closing of the polls?
      `the Court has determined otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Court of Chancery, on a stockholder's application, determined that it may be accepted?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the inspectors accept my proxy or ballot after the polls have closed (s 231(c))` IF
    `s 231(c) the inspectors may accept the ballot, proxy, vote, revocation or change` `it was received after the closing of the polls` `the Court has determined otherwise`

@export May the inspectors look at this information when they count the proxies and ballots (s 231(d))?
GIVEN `the information` IS A `dg5 s 231(d) Information the inspectors consider` @desc Which information? One of: the proxies; any envelopes submitted with the proxies; information provided in accordance with section 211(e) or section 212(c)(2); information provided pursuant to section 211(a)(2)b.(i) or (iii); the ballots; the regular books and records of the corporation; other reliable information
      `it is used only to reconcile proxies and ballots that exceed what the proxy holder may cast or the stockholder holds` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the information used only for the limited purpose of reconciling proxies and ballots submitted by or for banks, brokers, their nominees or similar persons that represent more votes than the proxy holder is authorized to cast or the stockholder holds of record?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the inspectors look at this information when they count the proxies and ballots (s 231(d))` IF
    `s 231(d) the inspectors may consider the information in determining the validity and counting of proxies and ballots` `the information` `it is used only to reconcile proxies and ballots that exceed what the proxy holder may cast or the stockholder holds`

@export Does the inspectors' certification say what the Law requires about other information they used (s 231(d))?
GIVEN `they used other reliable information for the limited purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the inspectors consider other reliable information for the limited purpose of reconciling?
      `it names the precise information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certification specify the precise information considered?
      `it names the persons it came from` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it specify the person or persons from whom the information was obtained?
      `it says when it was obtained` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it specify when the information was obtained?
      `it says the means by which it was obtained` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it specify the means by which the information was obtained?
      `it gives the basis for believing it accurate and reliable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it give the basis for the inspectors' belief that the information is accurate and reliable?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the inspectors' certification say what the Law requires about other information they used (s 231(d))` IF
    `s 231(d) the certification under paragraph (b)(5) specifies what it must`
        (`dg5 s 231(d) Certification of other reliable information` OF `they used other reliable information for the limited purpose`, `it names the precise information`, `it names the persons it came from`, `it says when it was obtained`, `it says the means by which it was obtained`, `it gives the basis for believing it accurate and reliable`)

§ `Section 232 -- how and when notice reaches a stockholder`

-- Helper: the notice as the layer-1 module expects it. The seat asks one question for each way a notice is given, so each question asks only the facts that way needs.
GIVEN w IS A `dg5 s 232 Way a notice is given`
      rec IS A BOOLEAN
      dm IS A MAYBE DATE
      dr IS A MAYBE DATE
      dl IS A MAYBE DATE
      de IS A MAYBE DATE
      dp IS A MAYBE DATE
      ds IS A MAYBE DATE
      lg IS A BOOLEAN
      ob IS A BOOLEAN
      co IS A BOOLEAN
      rv IS A BOOLEAN
      fx IS A BOOLEAN
      bar IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `dg5 s 232 Notice given to a stockholder`
`dg5 seat notice` w rec dm dr dl de dp ds lg ob co rv fx bar MEANS
    `dg5 s 232 Notice given to a stockholder` WITH
          `the way the notice was given` IS w
        , `the notice is directed to the address on the corporation's records` IS rec
        , `the date the notice was deposited in the U.S. mail` IS dm
        , `the date the notice was received by the stockholder` IS dr
        , `the date the notice was left at the stockholder's address` IS dl
        , `the date the notice was directed to the stockholder by electronic transmission` IS de
        , `the date of the posting on the electronic network` IS dp
        , `the date of the separate notice of the posting` IS ds
        , `the electronic mail carries a prominent legend that it is an important notice regarding the corporation` IS lg
        , `the stockholder has notified the corporation of an objection to receiving notice by electronic mail` IS ob
        , `the stockholder consented to receive notice by that form of electronic transmission` IS co
        , `the stockholder has revoked that consent` IS rv
        , `the facsimile number is one at which the stockholder consented to receive notice` IS fx
        , `the date from which notice by electronic transmission is barred` IS bar

-- The date from which section 232(e) bars electronic notice, asked as "has it been barred, and from when".
GIVEN barred IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`dg5 seat the date electronic notice is barred from` barred d MEANS
    IF barred THEN JUST d ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN has IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`dg5 seat a date that may not exist` has d MEANS
    IF has THEN JUST d ELSE NOTHING

@export On what date was a notice mailed to me treated as given (s 232(a)(1))?
GIVEN `it was mailed to the address on the corporation's records` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice mailed to your mailing address as it appears on the corporation's records?
      `the date it was deposited in the U.S. mail` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the notice deposited in the U.S. mail, postage prepaid? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-10)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `On what date was a notice mailed to me treated as given (s 232(a)(1))` IS
    `s 232 the date on which the notice is given`
        (`dg5 seat notice` `by mail deposited in the U.S. mail with postage prepaid` `it was mailed to the address on the corporation's records` (JUST `the date it was deposited in the U.S. mail`)
            -- Placeholders: the date rule does not read the other fields for a mailed notice.
            NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING)

@export On what date was a notice sent to me by courier treated as given (s 232(a)(2))?
GIVEN `it was sent to the address on the corporation's records` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice sent to your mailing address as it appears on the corporation's records?
      `it was received by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive the notice?
      `the date I received it` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
      `it was left at my address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice left at your address?
      `the date it was left at my address` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `On what date was a notice sent to me by courier treated as given (s 232(a)(2))` IS
    `s 232 the date on which the notice is given`
        (`dg5 seat notice` `by courier service` `it was sent to the address on the corporation's records` NOTHING (`dg5 seat a date that may not exist` `it was received by me` `the date I received it`) (`dg5 seat a date that may not exist` `it was left at my address` `the date it was left at my address`)
            -- Placeholders: the date rule does not read the other fields for a courier notice.
            NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING)

@export On what date was an e-mail notice to me treated as given (s 232(a)(3))?
GIVEN `it was sent to the e-mail address on the corporation's records` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice e-mailed to your electronic mail address as it appears on the corporation's records?
      `it carries the legend` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the e-mail include a prominent legend that the communication is an important notice regarding the corporation?
      `I objected to e-mail notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you notified the corporation, in writing or by electronic transmission, of an objection to receiving notice by electronic mail?
      `the date it was e-mailed` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the notice directed to your electronic mail address? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-10)
      `electronic notice has been barred` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission, and has that inability become known to the secretary, an assistant secretary, the transfer agent or another person responsible for giving notice?
      `the date from which electronic notice is barred` IS A DATE @desc If so, from what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `On what date was an e-mail notice to me treated as given (s 232(a)(3))` IS
    `s 232 the date on which the notice is given`
        (`dg5 seat notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` `it was sent to the e-mail address on the corporation's records` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST `the date it was e-mailed`)
            -- Placeholders: the posting dates and the consent flags are not read for an e-mail notice.
            NOTHING NOTHING
            `it carries the legend` `I objected to e-mail notice` FALSE FALSE FALSE
            (`dg5 seat the date electronic notice is barred from` `electronic notice has been barred` `the date from which electronic notice is barred`))

@export On what date was a facsimile notice to me treated as given (s 232(c)(1))?
GIVEN `it was sent to a number I consented to` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice directed to a facsimile number at which you consented to receive notice?
      `I have revoked that consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that consent?
      `the date it was faxed` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the notice directed to that number? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-10)
      `electronic notice has been barred` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission, and has that inability become known to the secretary, an assistant secretary, the transfer agent or another person responsible for giving notice?
      `the date from which electronic notice is barred` IS A DATE @desc If so, from what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `On what date was a facsimile notice to me treated as given (s 232(c)(1))` IS
    `s 232 the date on which the notice is given`
        (`dg5 seat notice` `by facsimile telecommunication directed to a number` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST `the date it was faxed`) NOTHING NOTHING
            -- Placeholders: the legend and objection flags are for e-mail; the general consent flag is not read for a facsimile.
            FALSE FALSE FALSE `I have revoked that consent` `it was sent to a number I consented to`
            (`dg5 seat the date electronic notice is barred from` `electronic notice has been barred` `the date from which electronic notice is barred`))

@export On what date was a posting-and-separate-notice to me treated as given (s 232(c)(2))?
GIVEN `I consented to notice by posting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you consent to receive notice by a posting on an electronic network?
      `I have revoked that consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that consent?
      `the date of the posting` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the notice posted on the electronic network? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-10)
      `I was given separate notice of the posting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you given separate notice of that specific posting?
      `the date of the separate notice` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
      `electronic notice has been barred` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission, and has that inability become known to the secretary, an assistant secretary, the transfer agent or another person responsible for giving notice?
      `the date from which electronic notice is barred` IS A DATE @desc If so, from what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `On what date was a posting-and-separate-notice to me treated as given (s 232(c)(2))` IS
    `s 232 the date on which the notice is given`
        (`dg5 seat notice` `by a posting on an electronic network together with separate notice of that posting` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST `the date of the posting`) (`dg5 seat a date that may not exist` `I was given separate notice of the posting` `the date of the separate notice`)
            -- Placeholders: the legend, objection and facsimile flags are not read for a posting.
            FALSE FALSE `I consented to notice by posting` `I have revoked that consent` FALSE
            (`dg5 seat the date electronic notice is barred from` `electronic notice has been barred` `the date from which electronic notice is barred`))

@export On what date was any other electronic notice to me treated as given (s 232(c)(3))?
GIVEN `I consented to notice in that form` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you consent to receive notice by that form of electronic transmission?
      `I have revoked that consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that consent?
      `the date it was directed to me` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the notice directed to you? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-10)
      `electronic notice has been barred` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission, and has that inability become known to the secretary, an assistant secretary, the transfer agent or another person responsible for giving notice?
      `the date from which electronic notice is barred` IS A DATE @desc If so, from what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `On what date was any other electronic notice to me treated as given (s 232(c)(3))` IS
    `s 232 the date on which the notice is given`
        (`dg5 seat notice` `by any other form of electronic transmission directed to the stockholder` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST `the date it was directed to me`) NOTHING NOTHING
            -- Placeholders: the legend, objection and facsimile flags are not read for another form of electronic transmission.
            FALSE FALSE `I consented to notice in that form` `I have revoked that consent` FALSE
            (`dg5 seat the date electronic notice is barred from` `electronic notice has been barred` `the date from which electronic notice is barred`))

@export From what date may notice by electronic transmission no longer be given (s 232(e))?
GIVEN `the corporation was unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the corporation unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission?
      `the date the inability became known` IS A DATE @desc On what date did that inability become known to the secretary, an assistant secretary, the transfer agent or another person responsible for giving notice? (ISO 8601; any date if it has not)
      `it has become known` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that inability become known to one of them?
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `From what date may notice by electronic transmission no longer be given (s 232(e))` IS
    `s 232(e) the date from which notice by electronic transmission is barred` `the corporation was unable to deliver 2 consecutive notices by electronic transmission` (`dg5 seat a date that may not exist` `it has become known` `the date the inability became known`)

@export Is a meeting invalid because the inability to deliver notices electronically was not discovered (s 232(e))?
GIVEN `the failure to discover was inadvertent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the failure to discover the inability inadvertent?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a meeting invalid because the inability to deliver notices electronically was not discovered (s 232(e))` IS
    `s 232(e) the meeting or other action is invalidated by the failure to discover the inability` `the failure to discover was inadvertent`

@export Is this communication an electronic transmission (s 232(d)(1))?
GIVEN `it does not directly involve the physical transmission of paper` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the communication not directly involve the physical transmission of paper?
      `it creates a record I can retain, retrieve and review` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it create a record that the recipient may retain, retrieve and review?
      `it can be reproduced directly in paper form by an automated process` IS A BOOLEAN @desc May that record be directly reproduced in paper form by the recipient through an automated process?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this communication an electronic transmission (s 232(d)(1))` IF
    `s 232(d)(1) the communication is an electronic transmission` `it does not directly involve the physical transmission of paper` `it creates a record I can retain, retrieve and review` `it can be reproduced directly in paper form by an automated process`

@export Is this destination an electronic mail address (s 232(d)(3))?
GIVEN `it has a unique user name or mailbox` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it consist of a unique user name or mailbox (the local part)?
      `it has an internet domain` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it have a reference to an internet domain (the domain part), whether or not displayed?
      `electronic mail can be sent or delivered to it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can electronic mail be sent or delivered to it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this destination an electronic mail address (s 232(d)(3))` IF
    `s 232(d)(3) the destination is an electronic mail address` `it has a unique user name or mailbox` `it has an internet domain` `electronic mail can be sent or delivered to it`

@export Is this communication electronic mail (s 232(d)(2))?
GIVEN `it is an electronic transmission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the communication an electronic transmission?
      `it is directed to an electronic mail address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it directed to a unique electronic mail address?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this communication electronic mail (s 232(d)(2))` IF
    `s 232(d)(2) the communication is electronic mail` `it is an electronic transmission` `it is directed to an electronic mail address`

@export Are the attached files and linked information part of the electronic mail notice (s 232(d)(2))?
GIVEN `the matter is a hyperlinked website` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter information hyperlinked to a website (rather than a file attached to the e-mail)?
      `the e-mail gives the contact information of an officer or agent who can help` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the e-mail include the contact information of an officer or agent of the corporation who is available to assist with accessing the files and information?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are the attached files and linked information part of the electronic mail notice (s 232(d)(2))` IF
    `s 232(d)(2) the matter is deemed included in the electronic mail`
        (IF `the matter is a hyperlinked website` THEN `information hyperlinked to a website from the electronic mail` ELSE `a file attached to the electronic mail`)
        `the e-mail gives the contact information of an officer or agent who can help`

@export Is the secretary's affidavit that notice was given evidence against me (s 232(f))?
GIVEN `the affidavit is by the secretary or another authorised agent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the affidavit by the secretary or an assistant secretary, or the transfer agent or another agent of the corporation?
      `the affidavit says notice was given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the affidavit state that notice has been given?
      `there is fraud` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there fraud?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the secretary's affidavit that notice was given evidence against me (s 232(f))` IF
    `s 232(f) the affidavit is prima facie evidence of the facts stated in it` `the affidavit is by the secretary or another authorised agent` `the affidavit says notice was given` `there is fraud`

@export Is a document enclosed with a notice part of the notice (s 232(g))?
GIVEN `the notice was mailed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice mailed?
      `the notice was delivered by courier` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice delivered by courier service?
      `the document is enclosed, annexed or appended` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the document enclosed with, annexed to or appended to the notice?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a document enclosed with a notice part of the notice (s 232(g))` IF
    `s 232(g) the document is deemed part of the notice for the purpose of deciding whether notice was duly given`
        (IF `the notice was mailed`
         THEN `by mail deposited in the U.S. mail with postage prepaid`
         ELSE IF `the notice was delivered by courier`
              THEN `by courier service`
              ELSE `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address`)
        `the document is enclosed, annexed or appended`

@export Does this part of section 232 apply to a notice under another section (s 232(h))?
GIVEN `the provision of section 232` IS A `dg5 s 232(h) Provision of section 232` @desc Which provision of section 232? One of: paragraph (a)(1) of section 232; paragraph (d)(2) of section 232; paragraph (d)(3) of section 232; another provision of section 232
      `the section under which the notice is given` IS A NUMBER @desc Under which section of the Law is the notice given? (for example 164, 296, 311, 312 or 324)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does this part of section 232 apply to a notice under another section (s 232(h))` IF
    `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `the provision of section 232` `the section under which the notice is given`

§ `Section 233 -- one notice for stockholders who share an address`

@export Is a single written notice sent to my household effective as to me (s 233(a))?
GIVEN `I consented to receive a single notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you consent to the corporation giving one written notice to the stockholders who share your address?
      `I am deemed to have consented under s 233(b)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you deemed to have consented because you did not object in writing within 60 days of written notice of the corporation's intention?
      `I revoked my consent in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a single written notice sent to my household effective as to me (s 233(a))` IF
    `s 233(a) the single written notice is effective as to the stockholder`
        (`dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` OF `I consented to receive a single notice`, `I am deemed to have consented under s 233(b)`, `I revoked my consent in writing`)

@export May we send one written notice to the stockholders who share an address (s 233(a))?
GIVEN `the stockholder consented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the stockholder consent to receiving one written notice with the others who share the address?
      `the stockholder is deemed to have consented under s 233(b)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the stockholder deemed to have consented under section 233(b)?
      `the stockholder revoked consent in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May we send one written notice to the stockholders who share an address (s 233(a))` IF
    `s 233(a) the single written notice is effective as to the stockholder`
        (`dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` OF `the stockholder consented`, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented under s 233(b)`, `the stockholder revoked consent in writing`)

@export Am I deemed to have consented to receiving a single notice (s 233(b))?
GIVEN `the date the corporation gave me written notice of its intention` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the corporation give you written notice of its intention to send a single notice to the stockholders at your address? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-01-01)
      `I objected in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you object in writing to the corporation?
      `the date I objected` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (ISO 8601; any date if not)
      `today's date` IS A DATE @desc What is today's date? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-03)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I deemed to have consented to receiving a single notice (s 233(b))` IS
    `s 233(b) the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice` `the date the corporation gave me written notice of its intention` (`dg5 seat a date that may not exist` `I objected in writing` `the date I objected`) `today's date`

@export Does section 233 apply to a notice under another section (s 233(d))?
GIVEN `the section under which the notice is given` IS A NUMBER @desc Under which section of the Law is the notice given? (for example 164, 296, 311, 312 or 324)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does section 233 apply to a notice under another section (s 233(d))` IF
    `s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` `the section under which the notice is given`

§ `Section 241 -- amending the certificate of incorporation before any stock has been paid for`

@export May the corporation amend its certificate of incorporation before it has received payment for any of its stock (s 241(a))?
GIVEN `the corporation is a stock corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation a stock corporation (one authorized to issue capital stock)? Answer no for a nonstock corporation.
      `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation received payment for any of its stock?
      `the nonstock corporation has members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If it is a nonstock corporation, does it have members yet?
      `the amended certificate would contain only lawful and proper provisions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the certificate as amended contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation amend its certificate of incorporation before it has received payment for any of its stock (s 241(a))` IF
    `s 241(a) the corporation may amend its certificate of incorporation` (`dg5 seat the kind of corporation` `the corporation is a stock corporation` FALSE) `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members` `the amended certificate would contain only lawful and proper provisions`

@export Has the amendment been adopted by the incorporators or the directors, as section 241 requires (s 241(b))?
GIVEN `directors were named or have been elected and have qualified` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were directors named in the original certificate of incorporation, or have directors been elected and qualified? (If not, the incorporators adopt.)
      `the number of incorporators` IS A NUMBER @desc How many incorporators are there?
      `the number of incorporators voting in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many incorporators vote in favor of the amendment?
      `the number of directors` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors are there (for a nonstock corporation, members of the governing body)?
      `the number of directors voting in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors vote in favor of the amendment?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has the amendment been adopted by the incorporators or the directors, as section 241 requires (s 241(b))` IS
    `s 241(b) the amendment has been adopted by the incorporators or the directors`
        (`dg5 s 241(b) Adoption of an amendment before payment` OF `directors were named or have been elected and have qualified`, `the number of incorporators`, `the number of incorporators voting in favor`, `the number of directors`, `the number of directors voting in favor`)

@export Is the certificate of amendment in order (s 241(b))?
GIVEN `it sets forth the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate set forth the amendment?
      `it certifies no payment was received or there are no members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it certify that the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock, or that it has no members, as applicable?
      `it certifies the amendment was duly adopted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it certify that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 241?
      `it was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the certificate of amendment in order (s 241(b))` IF
    `s 241(b) the certificate of amendment is in order` `it sets forth the amendment` `it certifies no payment was received or there are no members` `it certifies the amendment was duly adopted` `it was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`

@export From what date is the amendment effective as to me (s 241(b))?
GIVEN `the date the original certificate became effective` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the original certificate of incorporation become effective? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-03-01)
      `the filing date of the amendment` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the amendment filed (the filing date under section 103)? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2026-06-01)
      `I am substantially and adversely affected by the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you substantially and adversely affected by the amendment?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `From what date is the amendment effective as to me (s 241(b))` IS
    `s 241(b) the date from which the amendment is effective as to the person` `the date the original certificate became effective` `the filing date of the amendment` `I am substantially and adversely affected by the amendment`

§ `Section 242 -- amending the certificate of incorporation after stock has been paid for`

@export May the corporation amend its certificate of incorporation now that it has received payment for stock (s 242(a))?
GIVEN `the corporation is a stock corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation a stock corporation (one authorized to issue capital stock)? Answer no for a nonstock corporation.
      `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation received payment for any of its capital stock?
      `the nonstock corporation has members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If it is a nonstock corporation, does it have members?
      `the amended certificate would contain only lawful and proper provisions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the certificate as amended contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation amend its certificate of incorporation now that it has received payment for stock (s 242(a))` IF
    `s 242(a) the corporation may amend its certificate of incorporation` (`dg5 seat the kind of corporation` `the corporation is a stock corporation` FALSE) `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members` `the amended certificate would contain only lawful and proper provisions`

@export May several changes to the certificate be made in one certificate of amendment (s 242(a))?
GIVEN `the number of changes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many changes (name, business or powers, authorized capital stock, accrued dividends, new classes, duration, deletions) do you want to make?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May several changes to the certificate be made in one certificate of amendment (s 242(a))` IF
    `s 242(a) the changes may be effected by 1 certificate of amendment` `the number of changes`

§§ `If a corporation with capital stock proposes an amendment (section 242(b)(1))`

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      v IS A NUMBER
      o IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Vote of a class on an amendment`
`dg5 seat class vote` a v o MEANS
    `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Vote of a class on an amendment` WITH
          `the class is entitled to vote as a class on the amendment` IS a
        , `the number of votes of the class in favor of the amendment` IS v
        , `the number of outstanding votes of the class` IS o

@export Has the stockholders' amendment of the certificate been duly adopted (s 242(b)(1))?
GIVEN `the board adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors adopt a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed?
      `the resolution declared the amendment advisable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the resolution declare the amendment advisable?
      `the resolution called a meeting or directed it to the next annual meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the resolution call a special meeting of the stockholders entitled to vote, or direct that the amendment be considered at the next annual meeting?
      `the meeting was called on notice in accordance with s 222` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the meeting called and held upon notice in accordance with section 222?
      `the notice set forth the amendment or a brief summary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the notice set forth the amendment in full or a brief summary of the changes?
      `the notice is a notice of internet availability of proxy materials` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice constitute a notice of internet availability of proxy materials under the rules under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934?
      `a vote of stockholders is required` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a vote of stockholders required to adopt the amendment?
      `the votes in favor of the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast in favor of the amendment (counting votes of all the outstanding stock entitled to vote)?
      `the outstanding votes entitled to vote on the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock entitled to vote on the amendment carry in all?
      `the first class is entitled to vote as a class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there a class of stock entitled to vote on the amendment as a class?
      `the votes of the first class in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of that class were in favor? (0 if there is no such class)
      `the outstanding votes of the first class` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock of that class carry? (0 if there is no such class)
      `the second class is entitled to vote as a class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there a second class entitled to vote as a class?
      `the votes of the second class in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of the second class were in favor? (0 if there is no such class)
      `the outstanding votes of the second class` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does the outstanding stock of the second class carry? (0 if there is no such class)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has the stockholders' amendment of the certificate been duly adopted (s 242(b)(1))` IS
    `s 242(b)(1) the amendment has been duly adopted` `the adoption`
    WHERE
        `the adoption` MEANS `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Adoption of an amendment by a corporation with capital stock` WITH
              `the board of directors adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed` IS `the board adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment`
            , `the resolution declared the amendment advisable` IS `the resolution declared the amendment advisable`
            , `the resolution called a special meeting of the stockholders entitled to vote or directed that the amendment be considered at the next annual meeting` IS `the resolution called a meeting or directed it to the next annual meeting`
            , `the meeting was called and held upon notice in accordance with s 222` IS `the meeting was called on notice in accordance with s 222`
            , `the notice set forth the amendment in full or a brief summary of the changes` IS `the notice set forth the amendment or a brief summary`
            , `the notice constitutes a notice of internet availability of proxy materials under the rules promulgated under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934` IS `the notice is a notice of internet availability of proxy materials`
            , `a vote of stockholders is required to adopt the amendment` IS `a vote of stockholders is required`
            , `the number of votes in favor of the amendment` IS `the votes in favor of the amendment`
            , `the number of outstanding votes entitled to vote on the amendment` IS `the outstanding votes entitled to vote on the amendment`
            , `the classes entitled to vote as a class` IS LIST
                  (`dg5 seat class vote` `the first class is entitled to vote as a class` `the votes of the first class in favor` `the outstanding votes of the first class`),
                  (`dg5 seat class vote` `the second class is entitled to vote as a class` `the votes of the second class in favor` `the outstanding votes of the second class`)

@export Does the amendment take effect in accordance with section 103 (s 242(b)(1))?
GIVEN `the amendment has been duly adopted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the amendment been duly adopted under section 242(b)(1)?
      `the certificate certifies due adoption` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate set forth the amendment and certify that it has been duly adopted in accordance with section 242?
      `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the amendment take effect in accordance with section 103 (s 242(b)(1))` IS
    `s 242(b)(1) the amendment becomes effective in accordance with s 103` (JUST `the amendment has been duly adopted`) `the certificate certifies due adoption` `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`

§§ `If a proposed amendment affects a class or series of stock (section 242(b)(2))`

GIVEN num IS A BOOLEAN
      par IS A BOOLEAN
      adv IS A BOOLEAN
      ser IS A BOOLEAN
      opt IS A BOOLEAN
      low IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Effect of a proposed amendment on a class`
`dg5 seat effect on a class` num par adv ser opt low MEANS
    `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Effect of a proposed amendment on a class` WITH
          `the amendment would increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class` IS num
        , `the amendment would increase or decrease the par value of the shares of the class` IS par
        , `the amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of the class so as to affect them adversely` IS adv
        , `the amendment would so affect only 1 or more series of the class and not the entire class` IS ser
        , `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote` IS opt
        , `the amendment would take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding` IS low

@export Do I get to vote as a class on the proposed amendment (s 242(b)(2))?
GIVEN `it changes the aggregate number of authorized shares of my class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of your class?
      `it changes the par value of my class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment increase or decrease the par value of the shares of your class?
      `it adversely alters the powers, preferences or special rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment alter or change the powers, preferences or special rights of the shares of your class so as to affect them adversely?
      `it so affects only some series and not the whole class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would it so affect only one or more series of the class and not the entire class?
      `the certificate lets a majority of the stock change the number` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate (the original, the amendment that created the class, or a later authorized one) provide that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote?
      `the number would go below the number outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding?
      `my shares are of the class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are your shares of the class that the amendment would affect?
      `my shares are of a series so affected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are your shares of a series that the amendment would so affect adversely?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Do I get to vote as a class on the proposed amendment (s 242(b)(2))` IF
    `s 242(b)(2) the holder is entitled to vote as a class`
        (`s 242(b)(2) the holders who vote as a class on the amendment`
            (`dg5 seat effect on a class` `it changes the aggregate number of authorized shares of my class` `it changes the par value of my class` `it adversely alters the powers, preferences or special rights` `it so affects only some series and not the whole class` `the certificate lets a majority of the stock change the number` `the number would go below the number outstanding`))
        `my shares are of the class` `my shares are of a series so affected`

-- s 242(b)(2), the other side of the same relation: the officer or director who has to see that the right class votes.
@export Which holders must vote as a class on the proposed amendment (s 242(b)(2))?
GIVEN `it changes the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class?
      `it changes the par value of the class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment increase or decrease the par value of the shares of the class?
      `it adversely alters the powers, preferences or special rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment alter or change the powers, preferences or special rights of the shares of the class so as to affect them adversely?
      `it so affects only some series and not the whole class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would it so affect only one or more series of the class and not the entire class?
      `the certificate lets a majority of the stock change the number` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate (the original, the amendment that created the class, or a later authorized one) provide that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote?
      `the number would go below the number outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the amendment take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding?
GIVETH A `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Who votes as a class`
DECIDE `Which holders must vote as a class on the proposed amendment (s 242(b)(2))` IS
    `s 242(b)(2) the holders who vote as a class on the amendment`
        (`dg5 seat effect on a class` `it changes the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class` `it changes the par value of the class` `it adversely alters the powers, preferences or special rights` `it so affects only some series and not the whole class` `the certificate lets a majority of the stock change the number` `the number would go below the number outstanding`)

@export Can the number of authorized shares of a class be changed by a majority of all the stock entitled to vote, without a class vote (s 242(b)(2))?
GIVEN `the certificate lets a majority of the stock change the number` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate (the original, the amendment that created the class, or a later authorized one) provide that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote?
      `the number would go below the number outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the change take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can the number of authorized shares of a class be changed by a majority of all the stock entitled to vote, without a class vote (s 242(b)(2))` IF
    `s 242(b)(2) the number of authorized shares may be changed by a majority of the stock entitled to vote irrespective of the class vote`
        (`dg5 seat effect on a class`
            -- Placeholders: the rule reads only the last two flags.
            FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the certificate lets a majority of the stock change the number` `the number would go below the number outstanding`)

§§ `If the corporation is a nonstock corporation, or its certificate asks for a greater vote (section 242(b)(3), (4))`

@export Has the nonstock corporation's amendment of its certificate been duly adopted (s 242(b)(3))?
GIVEN `the governing body adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment and declaring its advisability` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the governing body adopt a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed and declaring its advisability?
      `the number of members of the governing body` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members does the governing body have in all?
      `the number of them voting in favor` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members of the governing body vote in favor of the amendment?
      `the certificate requires approval by a number or percentage of the members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate require the amendment to be approved by a specified number or percentage of the members, or of a specified class of members?
      `the members approved it by that number or percentage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If so, did the members (or class of members) approve it by that number or percentage?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Has the nonstock corporation's amendment of its certificate been duly adopted (s 242(b)(3))` IS
    `s 242(b)(3) the amendment has been duly adopted`
        (`dg5 s 242(b)(3) Adoption of an amendment by a nonstock corporation` OF `the governing body adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment and declaring its advisability`, `the number of members of the governing body`, `the number of them voting in favor`, `the certificate requires approval by a number or percentage of the members`, `the members approved it by that number or percentage`)

@export Does the vote carry to alter a provision of the certificate that requires a greater vote (s 242(b)(4))?
GIVEN `the certificate requires a greater vote than any section requires` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate require, for action by the board, the governing body, a class or series, the members or holders of other voting securities, a greater vote than any section of the Law requires?
      `the parts of the vote required` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the top of the fraction that the certificate's greater vote requires? (for two-thirds: 2)
      `out of these parts` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the bottom of that fraction? (for two-thirds: 3)
      `the vote must exceed the fraction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Must the vote exceed that fraction (as for "a majority"), rather than only reach it (as for "at least two-thirds")?
      `the votes in favor of altering the provision` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes are in favor of altering, amending or repealing the provision?
      `the votes that may be cast` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes may be cast in all?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the vote carry to alter a provision of the certificate that requires a greater vote (s 242(b)(4))` IS
    IF `out of these parts` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN CONSIDER `s 242(b)(4) the vote needed to alter, amend or repeal the provision requiring the greater vote` `the greater vote`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
         WHEN JUST required THEN `the vote carries` required `the votes in favor of altering the provision` `the votes that may be cast`
    ELSE NOTHING
    WHERE
        `the greater vote` MEANS
            IF `the certificate requires a greater vote than any section requires`
            THEN JUST (`Vote requirement` WITH `counted against` IS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`
                                              , proportion IS `the parts of the vote required` DIVIDED BY `out of these parts`
                                              , `must be exceeded` IS `the vote must exceed the fraction`)
            ELSE NOTHING

§§ `Abandoning an amendment, and amendments that need no stockholder vote (section 242(c), (d))`

@export May the board abandon the proposed amendment without asking the stockholders again (s 242(c))?
GIVEN `the resolution provides for abandonment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution authorizing the proposed amendment provide that the board of directors or governing body may abandon it before the filing becomes effective?
      `the filing has become effective` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the filing of the amendment with the Secretary of State become effective?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the board abandon the proposed amendment without asking the stockholders again (s 242(c))` IF
    `s 242(c) the board of directors or governing body may abandon the proposed amendment without further action by the stockholders or members` `the resolution provides for abandonment` `the filing has become effective`

GIVEN m IS A BOOLEAN
      s IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      o IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 242(d) Certificate provision on the number of authorized shares`
`dg5 seat certificate provision` m s g o MEANS
    `dg5 s 242(d) Certificate provision on the number of authorized shares` WITH
          `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of 1 or more classes may be increased or decreased by a majority of the stock entitled to vote irrespective of the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)` IS m
        , `that provision expressly states that the corporation is not to be governed by paragraph (d)(1) or (2), or both` IS s
        , `that provision requires a greater or additional vote than is contemplated by the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)` IS g
        , `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a meeting or vote of stockholders` IS o

@export Does my certificate expressly require a stockholder vote that subsection (d) would otherwise dispense with (s 242(d))?
GIVEN `the certificate has a majority-vote provision on authorized shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate provide that the number of authorized shares of one or more classes may be changed by a majority of the stock entitled to vote, irrespective of the last sentence of section 242(b)(2)?
      `that provision says the corporation is not governed by (d)(1) or (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that provision expressly state that the corporation is not to be governed by paragraph (d)(1) or (2), or both?
      `that provision requires a greater or additional vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that provision require a greater or additional vote than the last sentence of section 242(b)(2) contemplates?
      `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate otherwise expressly require a meeting or vote of stockholders?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does my certificate expressly require a stockholder vote that subsection (d) would otherwise dispense with (s 242(d))` IF
    `s 242(d) the certificate expressly requires otherwise` (`dg5 seat certificate provision` `the certificate has a majority-vote provision on authorized shares` `that provision says the corporation is not governed by (d)(1) or (2)` `that provision requires a greater or additional vote` `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a vote`)

@export Does this amendment need a meeting or vote of the stockholders at all (s 242(d)(1))?
GIVEN `it changes the corporate name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the amendment change the corporate name?
      `it deletes the provisions naming the incorporators, first directors and original subscribers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it delete the provisions of the original certificate that named the incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares?
      `it deletes provisions that effected a stock change that has taken effect` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it delete provisions that were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective?
      `it makes some other change` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it make any other change to the certificate?
      `it subdivides the issued shares of a class into more shares of that class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it subdivide the issued shares of a class into a greater number of issued shares of the same class?
      `there is only 1 class of stock outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation have only 1 class of stock outstanding?
      `that class is divided into series` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that class divided into series?
      `issued shares before the subdivision` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class are issued before the subdivision?
      `issued shares after the subdivision` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class are issued after the subdivision?
      `authorized shares before the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class are authorized before the amendment?
      `authorized shares after the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class are authorized after the amendment?
      `the certificate has a majority-vote provision on authorized shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate provide that the number of authorized shares of one or more classes may be changed by a majority of the stock entitled to vote, irrespective of the last sentence of section 242(b)(2)?
      `that provision says the corporation is not governed by (d)(1) or (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that provision expressly state that the corporation is not to be governed by paragraph (d)(1) or (2), or both?
      `that provision requires a greater or additional vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that provision require a greater or additional vote than the last sentence of section 242(b)(2) contemplates?
      `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate otherwise expressly require a meeting or vote of stockholders?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does this amendment need a meeting or vote of the stockholders at all (s 242(d)(1))` IF
    `s 242(d)(1) no meeting or vote of stockholders is required to adopt the amendment`
        (`s 242(d)(1)(A) the amendment affects only changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7)` `the changes`)
        (`s 242(d)(1)(B) the amendment is a subdivision that needs no vote` `the subdivision`)
        (`s 242(d) the certificate expressly requires otherwise` (`dg5 seat certificate provision` `the certificate has a majority-vote provision on authorized shares` `that provision says the corporation is not governed by (d)(1) or (2)` `that provision requires a greater or additional vote` `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a vote`))
    WHERE
        `the changes` MEANS
            IF `it changes the corporate name`
            THEN `a change of the corporate name` FOLLOWED BY `the changes after the name`
            ELSE `the changes after the name`
        `the changes after the name` MEANS
            IF `it deletes the provisions naming the incorporators, first directors and original subscribers`
            THEN `the deletion of the provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares` FOLLOWED BY `the changes after the first deletion`
            ELSE `the changes after the first deletion`
        `the changes after the first deletion` MEANS
            IF `it deletes provisions that effected a stock change that has taken effect`
            THEN `the deletion of provisions of an amendment that were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective` FOLLOWED BY `the other changes`
            ELSE `the other changes`
        `the other changes` MEANS
            IF `it makes some other change`
            THEN `a change, substitution, enlargement or diminution of the nature of its business or its corporate powers and purposes` FOLLOWED BY EMPTY
            ELSE EMPTY
        `the subdivision` MEANS `dg5 s 242(d)(1) Subdivision of the issued shares of a class` OF `it subdivides the issued shares of a class into more shares of that class`, `there is only 1 class of stock outstanding`, `that class is divided into series`, `issued shares before the subdivision`, `issued shares after the subdivision`, `authorized shares before the amendment`, `authorized shares after the amendment`

@export Can a listed corporation change its authorized shares on a simple majority of votes cast, without the usual stockholder vote (s 242(d)(2))?
GIVEN `it changes the authorized number of shares of a class or combines issued shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the amendment increase or decrease the authorized number of shares of a class of capital stock, or reclassify by combining the issued shares of a class into a lesser number of issued shares of the same class?
      `the class is listed on a national securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares of the class listed on a national securities exchange immediately before the amendment becomes effective?
      `the class will meet the exchange's minimum holders requirement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares meet the exchange's listing requirements for the minimum number of holders immediately after the amendment becomes effective?
      `a meeting was called under (b)(1) and a single-class vote was taken` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a meeting called in accordance with section 242(b)(1) and a vote of the stockholders entitled to vote, voting as a single class, taken for and against the proposed amendment?
      `the votes cast for the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast for the amendment?
      `the votes cast against the amendment` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes were cast against the amendment?
      `it changes a class with no provision under the last sentence of (b)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the amendment increase or decrease the authorized number of shares of a class for which no provision has been made under the last sentence of section 242(b)(2)?
      `the votes of that class cast for` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes did the holders of that class cast for the amendment? (0 if not applicable)
      `the votes of that class cast against` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes did the holders of that class cast against it? (0 if not applicable)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Can a listed corporation change its authorized shares on a simple majority of votes cast, without the usual stockholder vote (s 242(d)(2))` IF
    `s 242(d)(2) the amendment may be made without the vote otherwise required by subsection (b)`
        (`dg5 s 242(d)(2) Amendment of the number of authorized shares by a listed corporation` OF `it changes the authorized number of shares of a class or combines issued shares`, `the class is listed on a national securities exchange`, `the class will meet the exchange's minimum holders requirement`, `a meeting was called under (b)(1) and a single-class vote was taken`, `the votes cast for the amendment`, `the votes cast against the amendment`, `it changes a class with no provision under the last sentence of (b)(2)`, `the votes of that class cast for`, `the votes of that class cast against`)

§ `Section 243 -- retiring stock`

@export May the corporation retire these shares by a resolution of its board (s 243(a))?
GIVEN `the board adopted a resolution to retire the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors adopt a resolution to retire the shares?
      `the shares are issued but not outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares issued but not outstanding?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation retire these shares by a resolution of its board (s 243(a))` IF
    `s 243(a) the corporation may retire the shares` `the board adopted a resolution to retire the shares` `the shares are issued but not outstanding`

@export What is the status of shares the corporation has retired (s 243(b))?
GIVEN `the certificate otherwise provides` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation provide otherwise than that retired shares become authorized and unissued shares of their class or series?
GIVETH A `dg5 s 243(b) Status of retired shares`
DECIDE `What is the status of shares the corporation has retired (s 243(b))` IS
    `s 243(b) the status of the retired shares` `the certificate otherwise provides`

@export Must a certificate be filed saying that retired shares cannot be reissued (s 243(b))?
GIVEN `the certificate prohibits reissuance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate of incorporation prohibit the reissuance of the retired shares, or their reissuance as part of a specific series only?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must a certificate be filed saying that retired shares cannot be reissued (s 243(b))` IF
    `s 243(b) a certificate stating that reissuance of the shares is prohibited must be filed` `the certificate prohibits reissuance`

@export How many authorized shares of the class or series remain after the certificate on retired shares takes effect (s 243(b))?
GIVEN `the authorized shares before` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class or series are authorized before the certificate becomes effective?
      `the retired shares that cannot be reissued` IS A NUMBER @desc How many retired shares of the class or series may not be reissued?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `How many authorized shares of the class or series remain after the certificate on retired shares takes effect (s 243(b))` IS
    `s 243(b) the number of authorized shares of the class or series after the certificate becomes effective` `the authorized shares before` `the retired shares that cannot be reissued`

@export Is the class or series wiped out of the certificate when all its authorized shares are retired (s 243(b))?
GIVEN `the authorized shares before` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the class or series are authorized before the certificate becomes effective?
      `the retired shares that cannot be reissued` IS A NUMBER @desc How many retired shares of the class or series may not be reissued?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the class or series wiped out of the certificate when all its authorized shares are retired (s 243(b))` IF
    `s 243(b) all reference to the class or series is eliminated from the certificate` `the authorized shares before` `the retired shares that cannot be reissued`

@export Must a reduction of capital that comes with the retirement go through section 244 (s 243(c))?
GIVEN `capital will be reduced by or in connection with the retirement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the corporation's capital be reduced by or in connection with the retirement of shares?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must a reduction of capital that comes with the retirement go through section 244 (s 243(c))` IF
    `s 243(c) the reduction of capital must be effected pursuant to s 244` `capital will be reduced by or in connection with the retirement`

§ `Section 244 -- reducing capital`

@export May the corporation reduce its capital in this way and by this amount (s 244)?
GIVEN `the way capital is to be reduced` IS A `dg5 s 244(a) Way of reducing capital` @desc In which way is capital to be reduced? One of: by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by retired shares; by applying capital to an otherwise authorized purchase or redemption of outstanding shares; by applying capital to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares; by transferring to surplus capital not represented by any particular class; by transferring to surplus the capital of issued par value shares in excess of their aggregate par value; by transferring to surplus some of the capital of issued shares without par value (use the full wording of the option)
      `the board resolved to reduce the capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors adopt a resolution to reduce the capital?
      `the amount of capital to be reduced` IS A NUMBER @desc How much capital is to be reduced, in dollars?
      `the capital of the retired shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What capital is represented by the retired shares, in dollars?
      `the capital of the shares purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged` IS A NUMBER @desc What capital is represented by the shares being purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged, in dollars?
      `the capital not allocated to any class` IS A NUMBER @desc What capital has not been allocated to any particular class of capital stock, in dollars?
      `the par value or stated capital of the new shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total aggregate par value or stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange, in dollars?
      `the capital of issued par value shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What capital is represented by the issued shares of par value capital stock, in dollars?
      `the aggregate par value of those shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate par value of those shares, in dollars?
      `the capital of issued shares without par value` IS A NUMBER @desc What capital is represented by the issued shares of capital stock without par value, in dollars?
      `the assets remaining after the reduction` IS A NUMBER @desc What would the corporation's assets remaining after the reduction be worth, in dollars?
      `the debts not otherwise provided for` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's debts for which payment has not been otherwise provided, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation reduce its capital in this way and by this amount (s 244)` IF
    `s 244 the corporation may reduce its capital`
        (`dg5 s 244(a) Proposed reduction of capital` OF `the way capital is to be reduced`, `the board resolved to reduce the capital`, `the amount of capital to be reduced`, `the capital of the retired shares`, `the capital of the shares purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged`, `the capital not allocated to any class`, `the par value or stated capital of the new shares`, `the capital of issued par value shares`, `the aggregate par value of those shares`, `the capital of issued shares without par value`)
        `the assets remaining after the reduction` `the debts not otherwise provided for`

@export Are the corporation's remaining assets enough to pay its debts, so that it may reduce its capital (s 244(b))?
GIVEN `the assets remaining after the reduction` IS A NUMBER @desc What would the corporation's assets remaining after the reduction be worth, in dollars?
      `the debts not otherwise provided for` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's debts for which payment has not been otherwise provided, in dollars?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Are the corporation's remaining assets enough to pay its debts, so that it may reduce its capital (s 244(b))` IF
    `s 244(b) the assets remaining after the reduction are sufficient to pay the debts` `the assets remaining after the reduction` `the debts not otherwise provided for`

@export Am I still liable for the unpaid part of my shares if the corporation reduces its capital (s 244(b))?
GIVEN `my shares have been fully paid` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have your shares been fully paid?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Am I still liable for the unpaid part of my shares if the corporation reduces its capital (s 244(b))` IS
    `s 244(b) the stockholder's liability on the shares not fully paid survives the reduction of capital` `my shares have been fully paid`

§ `Section 245 -- a restated certificate of incorporation`

@export May the corporation integrate its certificate into a single restated certificate (s 245(a))?
GIVEN `the restated certificate integrates all the provisions then in effect and operative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the restated certificate integrate into a single instrument all the provisions of the certificate that are then in effect and operative?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May the corporation integrate its certificate into a single restated certificate (s 245(a))` IF
    `s 245(a) the corporation may adopt the restated certificate of incorporation` `the restated certificate integrates all the provisions then in effect and operative`

@export How must the restated certificate be adopted (s 245(b))?
GIVEN `it merely restates and integrates` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the restated certificate merely restate and integrate the certificate, without further amending it?
      `no payment has been received for any stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation not received any payment for any of its stock?
      `the directors submit it to the stockholders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the directors submit the restated certificate to the stockholders for adoption?
GIVETH A `dg5 s 245(b) How the restated certificate is adopted`
DECIDE `How must the restated certificate be adopted (s 245(b))` IS
    `s 245(b) how the restated certificate must be adopted` `it merely restates and integrates` `no payment has been received for any stock` `the directors submit it to the stockholders`

@export Does the restated certificate say everything it must (s 245(c))?
GIVEN `it is designated as a restated certificate in its heading` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it specifically designated as a restated certificate in its heading?
      `it states the present name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the corporation's present name, in its heading or an introductory paragraph?
      `the name has been changed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation's name been changed since it was originally incorporated?
      `it states the original name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated?
      `it states the date the original certificate was filed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the date of filing of the original certificate with the Secretary of State?
      `it states that it was duly adopted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state that it was duly adopted in accordance with section 245?
      `the board adopted it without a stockholder vote` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it adopted by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders (other than under section 241, or without a vote of members under section 242(b)(3))?
      `it states that it only restates and there is no discrepancy` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state that it only restates and integrates and does not further amend, and that there is no discrepancy with the provisions as amended or supplemented?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the restated certificate say everything it must (s 245(c))` IF
    `s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must`
        (`dg5 s 245(c) Restated certificate of incorporation` OF `it is designated as a restated certificate in its heading`, `it states the present name`, `the name has been changed`, `it states the original name`, `it states the date the original certificate was filed`, `it states that it was duly adopted`, `the board adopted it without a stockholder vote`, `it states that it only restates and there is no discrepancy`)

@export Is it a further amendment to leave this provision out of the restated certificate (s 245(c))?
GIVEN `the provision omitted` IS A `dg5 s 245(c) Provision omitted from the restated certificate` @desc Which provision is omitted? One of: provisions of the original certificate which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares; provisions contained in an amendment as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective; any other provision
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is it a further amendment to leave this provision out of the restated certificate (s 245(c))` IS
    `s 245(c) the omission is deemed not to be a further amendment` `the provision omitted`

@export Does the restated certificate take the place of the original certificate (s 245(d))?
GIVEN `it was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the restated certificate executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does the restated certificate take the place of the original certificate (s 245(d))` IF
    `s 245(d) the restated certificate supersedes the original certificate of incorporation as theretofore amended or supplemented` `it was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`

@export What is the corporation's date of incorporation once the restated certificate is filed (s 245(d))?
GIVEN `the original date of incorporation` IS A DATE @desc What is the corporation's original date of incorporation? (ISO 8601, e.g. 2019-04-02)
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `What is the corporation's date of incorporation once the restated certificate is filed (s 245(d))` IS
    `s 245(d) the date of incorporation after the restated certificate is filed` `the original date of incorporation`

@export Is a change made in the restatement subject to another provision of the Law (s 245(e))?
GIVEN `the provision would apply to a separate certificate of amendment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the other provision of the Law apply if a separate certificate of amendment were filed to make the change?
      `the provision is inconsistent with section 245` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the other provision inconsistent with section 245?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a change made in the restatement subject to another provision of the Law (s 245(e))` IF
    `s 245(e) the amendment or change in the restatement is subject to the provision` `the provision would apply to a separate certificate of amendment` `the provision is inconsistent with section 245`
